# Paths excluded from graphify ingest (gitignore syntax; read by
# `graphify update` / `graphify watch`). Rationale: the graph's god-node list
# was dominated by noise — test fixtures, changelog headings, a stale worktree
# copy, and graphify's own query-memory outputs ingested as first-class nodes —
# burying genuine hubs (mainwindow, ScrollManager, ApplicationContext).
#
# NOTE: Q_OBJECT (a macro symbol, 254 edges) cannot be excluded here —
# .graphifyignore is path-based only; graphify has no symbol-level exclude.
tests/
CHANGELOG.md
.claude/worktrees/
graphify-out/
